Campaign: {{ $json.campaignId }}
Amount: ${{ $json.claimAmount }}
Deal Value: ${{ $json.dealValue.toLocaleString() }}
Reason: Exceeds $500 auto-approval threshold

To approve/deny, POST to:
POST /partner-promotions-spif with {
  action: 'review_claim',
  claimId: '{{ $json.claimId }}',
  decision: 'approve' | 'deny',
  comments: '...'
}

